d\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left(a\\leq_Tc\\land b\\leq_Tc\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Td\\land b\\leq_Td)\\to c\\leq_Td)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本式保留输入文件的最小上界定义，只改正文件名与局部谓词名，不补入其他含义的 exact pair 概念。已正确命名的最小上界条目及其依赖保持不变。来源页码沿用输入档案，仅作为背景出处，本轮未重新核验原书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$a,b,c\\in D_T$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JoinWitness}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JoinWitness}_T(a,b;c)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left(a\\leq_Tc\\land b\\leq_Tc\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Td\\land b\\leq_Td)\\to c\\leq_Td)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1788,"backlinks":[{"id":"914bd719b3f82780","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{JoinWitness}_T(a,b;c)$ 仅为 [[67-df-degree-join-witness]] 定义的局部最小上界缩写。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-join-witness]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-join-witness]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b"]}